strate the purpose of the giant clock (which is a lift)Added a few NPCs wandering in the Auditorium prior to Professor Zash's lecture to guide the player across the room.Fixed a few English and French typos.The timer during the Extraction puzzles is now more readable on black backgrounds.The mouse cursor is now hidden while playing with a su","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T14:27:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4139770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4139770":"2026-10-26T11:25:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4139770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:30Z"},"4572210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:25:31Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4139770","app_id":4139770,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:28Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"abd5839e891b23760dbf5fd2cd710da9132658cbda4ec6b6cd87f83699721c63","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"아카데미아 마법 학교에 들어가 보세요! 라스트 찬스: 탄생는 스토리텔링 게임과 캐주얼 퍼즐이 결합된 게임으로, 플레이어의 행동이 스토리 전개에 영향을 미칩니다. 퍼즐을 풀어 마법을 시전하고, 물약을 만들고, 유물을 강화하는 등 다양한 활동을 즐겨보세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Living Flame Creations"}],"developers":[{"name":"Living Flame Creations"